OL,5,G0232 The Documentary
OL,6,     FHow has a once-a-decade act of
OL,7,     Fpolitical admin turned into a
OL,8,     Frolling process of extreme
OL,9,     Fpolitical partisanship - and what
OL,10,     Fdoes it mean for the future of
OL,11,     FAmerican democracy?
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FSibylle Baier was horrified when
OL,17,     Fher son handed out copies of a
OL,18,     Frecord she'd made in her 20s to
OL,19,     Fguests at her 60th birthday party.
OL,20,     FWhat followed was a reaction
OL,21,     Fneither imagined.
